      <string id="Containers_Default">Containers › Default</string>
      <string id="Containers_Default_Explain">Set policies related to Multi-Account Containers.

Set policies related to containers (https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/addon/multi-account-containers/).

Currently you can set the initial set of containers.

For each container, you can specify the name, icon, and color.

name
icon
color

For more information visit: https://thunderbird.github.io/policy-templates/firefox/policies/main/#containers
</string>
