      <string id="OverrideFirstRunPage">Override the first run page</string>
      <string id="OverrideFirstRunPage_Explain">The page shown on the first run, instead of the built-in one.

If the value is an empty string (""), the first run page is not displayed.

Starting with Firefox 83, Firefox ESR 78.5, you can also specify multiple URLS separated by a vertical bar (|).

For more information visit: https://thunderbird.github.io/policy-templates/firefox/policies/main/#overridefirstrunpage
