      <string id="SearchEngines_Add_1">SearchEngines › Add (1)</string>
      <string id="SearchEngines_Add_1_Explain">Add new search engines. Although there are only five engines available in the ADMX template, there is no limit. To add more in the ADMX template, you can duplicate the XML.

Name is the name of the search engine. (Required)

URLTemplate is the search URL with {searchTerms} to substitute for the search term. (Required)

Method is either GET or POST

IconURL is a URL for the icon to use.

Alias is a keyword to use for the engine.

Description is a description of the search engine.

PostData is the POST data as name value pairs separated by &amp;.

SuggestURLTemplate is a search suggestions URL with {searchTerms} to substitute for the search term.

Encoding is the query charset for the engine. It defaults to UTF-8.

For more information visit: https://thunderbird.github.io/policy-templates/firefox/policies/main/#searchengines
</string>
      <string id="SearchEngines_Add_1_Method_GET">GET</string>
      <string id="SearchEngines_Add_1_Method_POST">POST</string>
